<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S DOUBLES FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Sunday's men's doubles</p>
<p>final at Wimbledon (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge (Australia)/Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat</p>
<p>2-Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands)/Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 7-6 (9-7) 5-7 6-3</p>
</text>
